WEBVTT

00:37:58.980 --> 00:38:01.896
Jerry Burger and colleagues
on uncommon commonalities;

00:38:01.920 --> 00:38:04.416
Karen Huang and colleagues
on asking questions;

00:38:04.440 --> 00:38:07.040
and Kerry Gibson and colleagues
on self-disclosure.

00:38:08.410 --> 00:38:09.602
And if you're interested,

00:38:09.626 --> 00:38:12.076
Vivek Murthy just published
a book about loneliness.

00:38:12.100 --> 00:38:13.726
It's called "Together."

00:38:13.750 --> 00:38:16.333
(Theme music)

00:38:21.480 --> 00:38:25.180
AG: If you could say one thing
to someone who feels lonely,

00:38:25.204 --> 00:38:26.558
what would you say to them?

00:38:26.582 --> 00:38:28.611
VM: I would say
that because you're lonely

00:38:28.635 --> 00:38:30.392
it does not mean that you're broken,